    imageCredit: null,
    authorName: "Nelofar Mohammadi",
    authorBio:
      "Nelofar Mohammadi was born and raised in Kabul, Afghanistan, where she began writing in seventh grade as a way to express resilience and hope. She was graduated from Tarbiat Private High School in Kabul in December 2021. After being displaced by the Taliban's return to power, she rebuilt her life in Tehran. She now works as an English translator and HR administrator, while continuing her studies in Business Administration at the American University of Afghanistan. Nelofar serves as a volunteer mentor for first-year students at AUAF. She has also volunteered with Rumie Library as an English translator to support access to education. Through her writing, work, and studies, she remains committed to empowering women and inspiring others to pursue their dreams despite hardship.",
