    authorName: "Nargis Qorbani",
    authorBio:
      "I am Nargis. I love playing football, but as a girl, I had to let go of that dream. From an early age, I helped my father with hard and challenging tasks because he had no sons, and I wanted to support him. I dreamed of becoming a pilot, a military officer in the air force, but that dream remained just a dream. Later, I discovered my passion for technology and robotics, seeing it as a key field in today's world. I plan to study robotics at a top international university, possibly in China. I have participated in programs like Amala Learning Bridge, UNITAR Youth Ambassador Asia Pacific, From Silence to Story, Creative Writing for Social Change, EmpowerHer Leadership Class, and the Amala Global Secondary Diploma. I also realized I have talent in writing and decided to start sharing my stories, hoping one day my book will be published.",
